<title>UK: Banque de la Mediterranee sets $100 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Banque de la Mediterranee sets $100 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Indosuez and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE DE LA MEDITERRANEE SA</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     8.625     MATURITY    12.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.75     PAY DATE    12.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    99.75     SPREAD	+285 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 50	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/LB</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  LEBANON   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
